re than just a store, it’s been a dream, a passion, and a space filled with memories, community, and love.<\/p><p>Thank you for every visit, every kind word, and every moment you’ve shared with us. Your support has meant the world.<\/p><p>Though it’s bittersweet to say goodbye, we’re ending this chapter with one final celebration, a closing sale with up to 75% off everything. This is your last chance to take home a piece of London Layers before it’s gone.<\/p><p>Let’s make these final days just as meaningful as the years that came before.<\/p><p>With all my love,<br\/><br\/><strong>Clara & the London Layers team<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"background_image_text_ri3YKq":{"type":"background-image-text","name":"Large image with text box","settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"TIMELESS QUALITY, CHOSEN WITH CARE","text":"<p>Susan’s Aspen Boutique is built on a simple belief: beautiful clothing should feel just as good as it looks. From refined everyday pieces to seasonal favorites, every item is thoughtfully selected with quality, comfort and timeless style in mind.<\/p><p>We’re proud to welcome customers who return for pieces they can wear, love and reach for season after season.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Susan_Olivia.png","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false}},"blocks_BXgnKT":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_5a00a50_ANmUep":{"type":"ai_gen_block_5a00a50","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<style>\n  .susans-usps {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    padding: 38px 40px 32px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .susans-usps__grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    column-gap: 40px;\n    row-gap: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .susans-usps__item {\n    text-align: cen